  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_01",
      "hash64": "E4F2D8E37D111C96",
      "text": "Oh, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_02",
      "hash64": "E4F2D7E37D111AE3",
      "text": "I hear that Nemona here will be taking you\\nto school?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_01",
      "hash64": "C21E4249095E5426",
      "text": "That’s right, ma’am. Leave it to me![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_03",
      "hash64": "E4F2D6E37D111930",
      "text": "So you’ve already managed to make a friend![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_04",
      "hash64": "E4F2DDE37D112515",
      "text": "And I read about all the wonderful teachers\\nyou’ll have looking after you at the school.\\c\\nPlus so many handy facilities you can use as much\\nas you like![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_05",
      "hash64": "E4F2DCE37D112362",
      "text": "Add in your new friend, Nemona, and it sounds\\nlike your school life is shaping up to be fantastic![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_09",
      "hash64": "E4F2E0E37D112A2E",
      "text": "Now, you’ll be staying in the school dorms, so I\\nwant you to promise me you’ll eat proper meals.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_06",
      "hash64": "E4F2DBE37D1121AF",
      "text": "Here’s a bit of spending money to start off with.\\nI also packed a lunch for your first day![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_10",
      "hash64": "E4EF53E37D0E04C0",
      "text": "Oh! And maybe you’d better take these, too.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_11",
      "hash64": "E4EF54E37D0E0673",
      "text": "Use them on that precious little partner of yours,\\nshould it get hurt in battle.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_12",
      "hash64": "E4EF55E37D0E0826",
      "text": "I know every day in your new life is going to be\\nfull of exciting experiences, far from home.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_13",
      "hash64": "E4EF56E37D0E09D9",
      "text": "Just try to savor them all—the good times and\\nthe hard times, too![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_07",
      "hash64": "E4F2DAE37D111FFC",
      "text": "But if you ever want to come back home, you\\nknow your bed is always ready for you.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_08",
      "hash64": "E4F2E1E37D112BE1",
      "text": "Oh, all right then! You two had better be off,\\nI suppose. Take care on the way to school![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_02",
      "hash64": "C21E4149095E5273",
      "text": "Your mother’s so nice, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_03",
      "hash64": "C21E4049095E50C0",
      "text": "Oh! But I was going to teach you how to catch\\nwild Pokémon! C’mon, vamos![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_04",
      "hash64": "C21E4749095E5CA5",
      "text": "This way![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
